{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "hinge-60-wide",
  "prompt": "做一个两件式铰链：固定叶片带销，活动叶片带轴套，活动件能绕销转至少 ±60°。两件必须能以独立实体分别导出，并且能沿销轴方向抽开分离。销轴为 Z 轴、过原点；销直径 6 mm；轴孔与销的直径间隙必须落在 0.40 到 0.55 mm 之间（偏松，便于打印后装配）。单位 mm。",
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "fixed",
      "selector": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "moving",
      "selector": "moving"
    }
  ],
  "joint": {
    "type": "revolute",
    "axisOrigin": [
      0,
      0,
      0
    ],
    "axisDirection": [
      0,
      0,
      1
    ],
    "borePartId": "moving",
    "movingPartId": "moving"
  },
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "distinct-exported-parts",
      "layer": "parts",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "diametral-clearance",
      "layer": "assembly",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "range",
        "min": 0.4,
        "max": 0.55,
        "unit": "mm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sampled-motion",
      "layer": "motion",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "disassembly-path",
      "layer": "assembly",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "source-motion",
      "layer": "motion",
      "required": true,
      "applicable": true,
      "expected": {
        "kind": "equals",
        "value": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "motion": {
    "rangeDeg": [
      -60,
      60
    ],
    "steps": 21
  },
  "disassembly": {
    "travelMm": 20,
    "steps": 9
  },
  "notes": [
    "The loose band is the printability variant: the same nominal design with a wider bore still has to pass the same kind of measurement.",
    "提交源码必须接受 pose.parameter 并以它为位姿：评测会按该参数重渲染，比较活动件质心与刚体变换，并确认固定件不随参数变化。"
  ],
  "pose": {
    "parameter": "hinge_angle",
    "unit": "deg",
    "values": [
      -60,
      0,
      60
    ],
    "toleranceMm": 0.5
  }
}
